{"type":"message","id":"401ab5c0","parentId":"63155aee","timestamp":"2026-03-12T14:55:44.498Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:f6b9edc7-5375-4a0a-b88b-3989ad8ab3eb skill-evolution-hourly] 执行自动进化任务：1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（搜索关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）；2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能；3. 安装有价值的技能；4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\nCurrent time: Thursday, March 12th, 2026 — 10:55 PM (Asia/Shanghai)\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1773327344497}}
{"type":"message","id":"1414e3b4","parentId":"401ab5c0","timestamp":"2026-03-12T14:55:52.495Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"这是一个定时任务（cron任务），要求我执行自动进化任务：\n1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能\n2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能\n3. 安装有价值的技能\n4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\n\n首先，我需要查看 clawhub skill 的指导文件来了解如何使用 ClawHub CLI。让我先读取相关的 SKILL.md 文件。\n\n根据 available_skills，clawhub 技能的描述是：使用 ClawHub CLI 搜索、安装、更新和发布 agent skills。\n\n让我先读取这个技能文件。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我来执行自动进化任务。首先读取 ClawHub 技能指导。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_82098dc4fd644f88aca9e5b3","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/opt/homebrew/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/clawhub/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":12065,"output":176,"cacheRead":3392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15633,"cost":{"input":0.012065,"output":0.0005632,"cacheRead":0.0006784,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.013306599999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773327344498}}
{"type":"message","id":"7a9829d7","parentId":"1414e3b4","timestamp":"2026-03-12T14:55:52.502Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_82098dc4fd644f88aca9e5b3","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: clawhub\ndescription: Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com. Use when you need to fetch new skills on the fly, sync installed skills to latest or a specific version, or publish new/updated skill folders with the npm-installed clawhub CLI.\nmetadata:\n  {\n    \"openclaw\":\n      {\n        \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"] },\n        \"install\":\n          [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"node\",\n              \"kind\": \"node\",\n              \"package\": \"clawhub\",\n              \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"],\n              \"label\": \"Install ClawHub CLI (npm)\",\n            },\n          ],\n      },\n  }\n---\n\n# ClawHub CLI\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nnpm i -g clawhub\n```\n\nAuth (publish)\n\n```bash\nclawhub login\nclawhub whoami\n```\n\nSearch\n\n```bash\nclawhub search \"postgres backups\"\n```\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nclawhub install my-skill\nclawhub install my-skill --version 1.2.3\n```\n\nUpdate (hash-based match + upgrade)\n\n```bash\nclawhub update my-skill\nclawhub update my-skill --version 1.2.3\nclawhub update --all\nclawhub update my-skill --force\nclawhub update --all --no-input --force\n```\n\nList\n\n```bash\nclawhub list\n```\n\nPublish\n\n```bash\nclawhub publish ./my-skill --slug my-skill --name \"My Skill\" --version 1.2.0 --changelog \"Fixes + docs\"\n```\n\nNotes\n\n- Default registry: https://clawhub.com (override with CLAWHUB_REGISTRY or --registry)\n- Default workdir: cwd (falls back to OpenClaw workspace); install dir: ./skills (override with --workdir / --dir / CLAWHUB_WORKDIR)\n- Update command hashes local files, resolves matching version, and upgrades to latest unless --version is set\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773327352500}}
